        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.37,
          "end": 51.44,
          "en": "It's available for macOS, Windows and Linux,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.44,
          "end": 53.64,
          "en": "so you can use it on any platform,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.64,
          "end": 58.62,
          "en": "and you can simply download and install it from that page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.62,
          "end": 61.95,
          "en": "And, once you did that, you can open the attached extracted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.95,
          "end": 66.95,
          "en": "folder with File, Open and then navigate to that folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.65,
          "end": 69.09,
          "en": "and open it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.09,
          "end": 71.7,
          "en": "You can close the welcome screen you might see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.7,
          "end": 74.73,
          "en": "in Visual Studio Code, and if you want to get the exact same",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.73,
          "end": 79.53999999999999,
          "en": "look as I do, under View, Appearance, you can control which",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.53999999999999,
          "end": 83.46000000000001,
          "en": "sidebars are visible or not visible, and I only have the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.46000000000001,
          "end": 86.16,
          "en": "sidebar and the editor area open.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.16,
          "end": 89.03999999999999,
          "en": "I, for example, don't have the activity bar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.03999999999999,
          "end": 90.88,
          "en": "which you might still have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.88,
          "end": 95.88,
          "en": "I am also zoomed in here, and under Code, Preferences,",
