        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 96.136,
          "end": 101.136,
          "en": "Color theme, I am using the Dark+ theme.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 101.17,
          "end": 103.257,
          "en": "Now, you can configure this however you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 103.257,
          "end": 106.86,
          "en": "but that is the style I am using.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 106.86,
          "end": 110.12,
          "en": "Now, with that, let's start writing some code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 110.12,
          "end": 112.2,
          "en": "and I will actually start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.2,
          "end": 115.9,
          "en": "by writing some non-view code first,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 115.9,
          "end": 118.07900000000001,
          "en": "so that we thereafter can see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.07900000000001,
          "end": 122.68299999999999,
          "en": "why using a framework like Vue.js might be a good idea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 123.66,
          "end": 126.07,
          "en": "On this demo project which I prepared,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 126.07,
          "end": 127.86,
          "en": "we can add Goals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.86,
          "end": 130.12,
          "en": "we've got a test goal at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.12,
          "end": 132.216,
          "en": "and we will delete that soon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.216,
          "end": 135.01,
          "en": "but, now, whenever I add a new goal here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.01,
          "end": 136.864,
          "en": "like 'Finish the course'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.864,
          "end": 140.38,
          "en": "I want to make sure when at 'Add Goal' is clicked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 140.38,
          "end": 143.835,
          "en": "this goal appears in that list down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 143.835,
          "end": 146.73,
          "en": "In the index.html file, we've got some",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 146.73,
          "end": 150.42000000000002,
          "en": "mark up for that input field label button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.42000000000002,
          "end": 153.26,
          "en": "and then that list with the dummy list item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.26,
          "end": 155.1,
          "en": "which we can delete now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.1,
          "end": 158.25,
          "en": "And, I'm importing some styles which I prepared for you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 158.25,
          "end": 159.946,
          "en": "we don't have to care about those,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.946,
          "end": 162.86,
          "en": "it's not a CSS course after all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.86,
          "end": 165.32999999999998,
          "en": "but we do all the import app.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.32999999999998,
          "end": 167.95,
          "en": "and here we can write some some JavaScript code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.95,
          "end": 171.27,
          "en": "to fetch the user input when the button is clicked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.27,
          "end": 172.89,
          "en": "create a new list item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.89,
          "end": 176.64,
          "en": "and add that to that list of list items here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.64,
          "end": 178.79500000000002,
          "en": "And, that's what I want to do first now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.79500000000002,
          "end": 182.87,
          "en": "with just JavaScript, so without Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.87,
          "end": 184.55,
          "en": "In app.js for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 184.55,
          "end": 188.21,
          "en": "we first of all need to get access to the input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.21,
          "end": 191.57,
          "en": "so that we can read the entered value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 191.57,
          "end": 193.53,
          "en": "we need to get access to the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 193.53,
          "end": 197.198,
          "en": "so that we can listen to click events on the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.198,
          "end": 200.53,
          "en": "and we need to get access to the unordered list here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 200.53,
          "end": 203.16,
          "en": "so that we can add new list items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203.16,
          "end": 205.49,
          "en": "Therefore, I will create three constants here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.49,
          "end": 206.63,
          "en": "in app.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 206.63,
          "end": 209.872,
          "en": "The first one is the buttonEl constant, lets say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 209.872,
          "end": 212.31,
          "en": "this name, of course, is up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 212.31,
          "end": 214.6,
          "en": "where I use document.querySelector",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 215.448,
          "end": 218.974,
          "en": "to select the only button we have on this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 218.974,
          "end": 223.974,
          "en": "So, now, pointer to that dom element, to that JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 224.67000000000002,
          "end": 228.3,
          "en": "object representation of that button element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 228.3,
          "end": 231.003,
          "en": "Is stored in that buttonEl const.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 232.2,
          "end": 233.93,
          "en": "I'll do the same for the input element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 233.93,
          "end": 237.52,
          "en": "with document.querySelector ('input')",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 239.02,
          "end": 244.02,
          "en": "and also for the listEl with document.querySelector ('ul')",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 246.35,
          "end": 247.563,
          "en": "for unread list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 249.4,
          "end": 253.54,
          "en": "Now, we can add a click Lister with JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 253.54,
          "end": 255.31,
          "en": "to this button by reaching out to the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 255.31,
          "end": 259.29,
          "en": "buttonEl and calling addEventListener,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 259.29,
          "end": 262.92,
          "en": "where we then listen to the click event like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 262.92,
          "end": 265.08,
          "en": "by passing click as a string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 265.08,
          "end": 266.603,
          "en": "as a first argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 267.6,
          "end": 269.9,
          "en": "The second argument now needs to be the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 269.9,
          "end": 274.27,
          "en": "function that should be executed when the click occurs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 274.27,
          "end": 277.564,
          "en": "For that, we can define a new function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 277.564,
          "end": 280.543,
          "en": "addGoal could be the name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 281.43,
          "end": 283.60699999999997,
          "en": "which should be triggered upon a click,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 283.60699999999997,
          "end": 287.14,
          "en": "so here we can then point at addGoal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 288.22,
          "end": 291.55,
          "en": "We don't execute it here, we just point at it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 291.55,
          "end": 293.99,
          "en": "by repeating its name, so that the function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 293.99,
          "end": 297.59000000000003,
          "en": "is executed for us when a click occurs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 297.59000000000003,
          "end": 299.71,
          "en": "Now, in this function we want to get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 299.71,
          "end": 301.67,
          "en": "whatever the user entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 301.67,
          "end": 304.64,
          "en": "So, we can get the entered value by",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 304.64,
          "end": 309.64,
          "en": "reaching out to inputEl.value, being an input element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 309.97,
          "end": 313.183,
          "en": "at which were pointing here, it will have a value property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 313.183,
          "end": 317.12,
          "en": "that's vanilla JavaScript, that's built into JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 317.12,
          "end": 320.56,
          "en": "that we have this value property on input elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 320.56,
          "end": 323.975,
          "en": "where we then can extract the value the user entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 323.975,
          "end": 325.323,
          "en": "into this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 326.67,
          "end": 331.67,
          "en": "And now, we can create a new list item element by calling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 334.09000000000003,
          "end": 339.09000000000003,
          "en": "document.createElement which is a built-in method provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 339.42,
          "end": 343.89,
          "en": "by the browser, to create new dom elements programmatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 343.89,
          "end": 345.85,
          "en": "with JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 345.85,
          "end": 348.76,
          "en": "Here, we can provide 'li' to create a list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 348.76,
          "end": 353.21,
          "en": "element, and then we can use that newly created list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 353.21,
          "end": 357.57,
          "en": "element to set its text content, so the text between the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 357.57,
          "end": 361.33,
          "en": "opening and closing text, of that list item, equal to the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 361.33,
          "end": 362.383,
          "en": "entered value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 363.38,
          "end": 366.67,
          "en": "And then, we can reach out to the listEl, so to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 366.67,
          "end": 371.67,
          "en": "our overall list, and call append or appendChild,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 372.31,
          "end": 375.773,
          "en": "both will work here, I'll go for appendChild,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 375.773,
          "end": 378.54,
          "en": "and append our list itemEl,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 378.54,
          "end": 380.61,
          "en": "which we just created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 380.61,
          "end": 385.14,
          "en": "If we do all of that, and we reload I can add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 385.14,
          "end": 388.23,
          "en": "'Finish the course!' and add this goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 388.23,
          "end": 393.23,
          "en": "And thereafter, for example, also add 'Learn Vue!'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 393.38,
          "end": 394.93,
          "en": "as a goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 394.93,
          "end": 397.65,
          "en": "Now, let's say we also want to reset the input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 397.65,
          "end": 400.9,
          "en": "once a goal was added, we could do that by, again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 400.9,
          "end": 403.83,
          "en": "using our inputEl and setting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 403.83,
          "end": 406.08,
          "en": "value equal to an empty string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 406.08,
          "end": 409.24,
          "en": "This will set the value in the input element to an",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 409.24,
          "end": 412.2,
          "en": "empty text, and therefore clears it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 412.2,
          "end": 414.7,
          "en": "So, with that if we reload again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 414.7,
          "end": 417.08,
          "en": "and I 'Finish the course!', now this would be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 417.08,
          "end": 418.65,
          "en": "cleared.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 418.65,
          "end": 422.74,
          "en": "Now, that's just JavaScript, no Vue in action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 422.74,
          "end": 427.5,
          "en": "and it's obviously a very very very trivial demo website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
